"""
dtWine — Common Desktop Environment (CDE) Wine Software & Old Game Manager
Tailored for Linux + Common Desktop Environment (dtwm) with OpenGL WineD3D.

Features:
- Installs GOG offline installers (setup_*.exe + goggame-*.info / .ico) and
  classic Windows games & applications (.exe, .msi, .bat, portable folders)
- Asks whether software is a Game or Application:
    * Game        -> extracts main game .exe icon & adds to CDE "Games" stack
                     (SUBPANEL PersPrintersSubpanel)
    * Application -> extracts main app .exe icon & adds to CDE "Personal Applications"
                     stack (SUBPANEL PersAppsSubpanel)
- Ignores junk installer shortcuts (Uninstall, Readme, Manual, Website, Setup, etc.)
- Pure-Python PE32 / PE32+ / 16-bit NE / ICO icon extractor with Win95/98 DIB
  1-bit AND-mask transparency -> CDE XPM (.l.pm, .pm, .m.pm, .s.pm, .t.pm)
- Broad GPU compatibility via OpenGL WineD3D (renderer=gl)
- Per-game Virtual Desktop mode, Windows version (win95..win10), Winetricks presets,
  patch/DLC runner, winecfg, regedit, wineserver -k, and live CDE Front Panel reload.
"""

